20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >企业里的标签开发流程和数据开发流程大致相同</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >&nbsp;</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"46"  src=3D"~tmp{fda92ea7-2706-488d-b703-0d03d32fb168}199424.files/~tmp{fda92ea7-2706-488d-b703-0d03d32fb168}1994243431.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h3 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >2.4.1&nbsp;需求提出</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h3><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >业务运营想要针对特定人群</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >/特定商品/特定商家进行针对性的运营时，希望可以借助CDP(Custormer Data Platform )圈选平台的买家/商品/商家标签，圈出来满足运营的人群/商品/商家。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >平台上如果没有满足运营诉求的标签可用，对应的运营就会跟平台</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >PD提出标签需求。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h3 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >2.4.2&nbsp;需求评审</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:13.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.